ga</span><span begin="02:24.153" end="02:24.918" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">nakere</span><span begin="02:24.918" end="02:25.298" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ba</span></text><text for="L33"><span begin="02:25.352" end="02:25.943" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">karakuri</span><span begin="02:25.943" end="02:26.197" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">no</span><span begin="02:26.197" end="02:26.763" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">naka</span><span begin="02:26.763" end="02:27.294" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">de</span><span begin="02:27.387" end="02:27.781" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">mawaru</span><span begin="02:27.781" end="02:28.264" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">boku</span><span begin="02:28.264" end="02:28.581" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ra</span><span begin="02:28.581" end="02:28.790" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">wa</span></text><text for="L34"><span begin="02:28.790" end="02:29.809" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">narisoko</span><span begin="02:29.809" end="02:30.343" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">nai</span><span begin="02:30.343" end="02:30.609" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">de</span><span begin="02:30.609" end="02:31.091" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">afu</span><span begin="02:31.091" end="02:31.393" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">re</span><span begin="02:31.393" end="02:31.685" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ta!</span></text><text for="L35"><span begin="02:31.795" end="02:32.633" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">sashie</span><span begin="02:32.633" end="02:32.934" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">no</span><span begin="02:32.934" end="02:33.668" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">you na</span><span begin="02:33.668" end="02:34.417" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">shiawa</span><span begin="02:34.417" end="02:34.918" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">se o</span><span begin="02:34.918" end="02:35.465" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">moto</span><span begin="02:35.465" end="02:35.868" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">mete</span><span begin="02:35.868" end="02:36.056" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">i</span><span begin="02:36.056" end="02:37.639" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ru</span></text><text for="L36"><span begin="02:37.649" end="02:38.187" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">kansei</span><span begin="02:38.187" end="02:38.571" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">wa</span><span begin="02:38.571" end="02:38.921" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">eno</span><span begin="02:38.921" end="02:39.433" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">gu</span><span begin="02:39.622" end="02:40.132" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">mazari</span><span begin="02:40.132" end="02:40.521" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ae</span><span begin="02:40.521" end="02:40.969" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ru</span></text><text for="L37"><span begin="02:41.086" end="02:41.622" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">kono</span><span begin="02:41.622" end="02:42.022" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">machi</span><span begin="02:42.022" end="02:42.273" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">de</span><span begin="02:42.273" end="02:42.781" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">atari</span><span begin="02:42.781" end="02:43.190" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">mae ni</span><span begin="02:43.190" end="02:43.667" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ima</span><span begin="02:43.924" end="02:44.803" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">kagaya</span><span begin="02:44.803" end="02:45.088" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ite</span><span begin="02:45.088" end="02:45.252" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">i</span><span begin="02:45.252" end="02:48.774" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ru!</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-CN"><text for="L1">细心明察秋毫不放</text><text for="L2">成熟的人定会如此 因而我们关心彼此</text><text for="L3">并乐此不疲</text><text for="L4">如果背后没有任何故事 即便珍珠的碎片也毫无价值</text><text for="L5">我们注定将在尔虞我诈中徘徊</text><text for="L6">其实我们度过的每一天 都仿佛奇迹 我们却索取得理所当然</text><text for="L7">内心是温热的 那么笑容越多 寂寞就会越少吧？</text><text for="L8">即便是消沉的夜晚 也会变得多彩而反复无常</text><text for="L9">每段人生都同样美好</text><text for="L10">明知自己在逞强 可至今为止</text><text for="L11">走过的足迹与已孕育出的事物 并不会消失</text><text for="L12">会被小小玩笑伤害的这份柔软</text><text for="L13">不需要刻意去改变 继续做自己就好</text><text for="L14">认认真真不遗漏一分一秒</text><text for="L15">成熟的人定会如此 因而我们关心彼此</text><text for="L16">并乐此不疲</text><text for="L17">如果背后没有任何故事 即便珍珠的碎片也毫无价值</text><text for="L18">我们注定将在尔虞我诈中徘徊</text><text for="L19">啊 没错</text><text for="L20">如果只有喜剧 我们就不会站在这里了</text><text for="L21">如今要排解烦闷无论去哪里都好</text><text for="L22">正如阳光倾洒 我们难以察觉</text><text for="L23">没有哪一滴泪是流错了的</text><text for="L24">不要遗漏任何意义</text><text for="L25">成熟的人定会如此 因而我们关心彼此</text><text for="L26">并乐此不疲</text><text for="L27">如果背后没有任何故事 即便珍珠的碎片也毫无价值</text><text for="L28">我们注定将在尔虞我诈中徘徊</text><text for="L29">细心明察秋毫不放</text><text for="L30">成熟的人定会如此 因而我们关心彼此</text><text for="L31">并乐此不疲</text><text for="L32">如果背后没有任何故事 即便珍珠的碎片也毫无价值</text><text for="L33">徘徊在尔虞我诈中的我们</text><text for="L34">渴望着没能得到的</text><text for="L35">洋溢在插画中的那种幸福</text><text for="L36">感性是颜料 混合在一起</text><text for="L37">如今在这座城市无所顾忌地闪耀着光辉</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="02:48.774"><div begin="00:00.729" end="02:48.774"><p begin="00:00.729" end="00:02.877" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:00.729" end="00:01.343">じっと</span><span begin="00:01.343" end="00:01.783">機微を</span><span begin="00:01.783" end="00:02.261">見逃さ</span><span begin="00:02.261" end="00:02.543">ない</span><span begin="00:02.543" end="00:02.877">で</span></p><p begin="00:02.887" end="00:07.653" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:02.887" end="00:03.286">きっと</span><span begin="00:03.286" end="00:03.813">大人は</span><span begin="00:03.813" end="00:04.331">それらし</span><span begin="00:04.331" end="00:04.679">く</span><span begin="00:04.679" end="00:05.479">するの</span><span begin="00:05.479" end="00:05.720">で</span><span begin="00:05.813" end="00:06.538">かかりきり</span><span begin="00:06.538" end="00:06.815">に</span><span begin="00:06.815" end="00:07.247">なるん</span><span begin="00:07.247" end="00:07.653">だ</span></p><p begin="00:07.863" end="00:09.488" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:07.863" end="00:08.412">関心</span><span begin="00:08.412" end="00:08.780">は</span><span begin="00:08.780" end="00:09.038">まだ</span><span begin="00:09.038" end="00:09.314">僕</span><span begin="00:09.314" end="00:09.488">ら</span></p><p begin="00:09.498" end="00:14.068" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:09.498" end="00:09.973">真珠</span><span begin="00:09.973" end="00:10.085">の</span><span begin="00:10.085" end="00:10.500">欠片</span><span begin="00:10.500" end="00:11.040">だって</span><span begin="00:11.040" end="00:11.394">無価値 </span><span begin="00:11.481" end="00:11.916">そこに</span><span begin="00:11.916" end="00:12.535">物語</span><span begin="00:12.535" end="00:12.865">が</span><span begin="00:12.865" end="00:13.630">なけれ</span><span begin="00:13.630" end="00:14.068">ば</span></p><p begin="00:14.074" end="00:17.957" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:14.074" end="00:14.689">からくり</span><span begin="00:14.689" end="00:14.977">の</span><span begin="00:14.977" end="00:15.460">なか</span><span begin="00:15.460" end="00:15.995">で</span><span begin="00:16.126" end="00:16.387">廻</span><span begin="00:16.387" end="00:16.542">る</span><span begin="00:16.542" end="00:17.004">僕</span><span begin="00:17.004" end="00:17.260">ら</span><span begin="00:17.260" end="00:17.526">命</span><span begin="00:17.526" end="00:17.957">だ</span></p><p begin="00:33.757" end="00:38.942" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:33.757" end="00:34.195">実は</span><span begin="00:34.195" end="00:35.102">奇跡のような</span><span begin="00:35.102" end="00:35.781">毎日を </span><span begin="00:35.867" end="00:36.622">当たり前に</span><span begin="00:36.622" end="00:37.211">手を差し</span><span begin="00:37.211" end="00:37.593">伸べ</span><span begin="00:37.593" end="00:37.941">あって</